 * Unit tests for js/postMobileTestAutomationResultsHelpers.js — pure helpers
 * extracted from js/postMobileTestAutomationResults.js (gh-979 CRAP split).
 *
 * Uses: loadModule(), makeRequire(), assert, test(), suite()
